    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Charge one slashing weapon you are wielding. On your next successful melee attack with it, if the weapon deals any damage, the spell adds 10d8 damage and then deals another 5d8 damage each round for 6 rounds.</p><p>If that successful attack deals no damage, including because damage reduction reduces it to 0, the spell discharges without effect. The spell is also lost if you cast another spell or stop wielding the charged weapon before discharge. The charged slashing weapon is the focus.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Track the charged weapon, discharge conditions, spell-resistance check, and six later damage rolls manually.</p>"
    },
